&lt;p&gt;We are particularly interested in individuals who have worked with enterprise companies and understand the dynamic culture of a smaller enterprise sales organization. Experience selling solutions that engage stakeholders across IT and business departments is highly valued. Familiarity with analytics, CRM, marketing automation, digital media publishing, or content marketing solutions would be an excellent fit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
