&lt;h1&gt;About Diligent&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diligent is the global leader in governance, risk and compliance (GRC) SaaS solutions, trusted by more than 1 million users and 700,000 board and leadership seat holders across 90+ countries. Our Diligent One Platform gives practitioners, the C-Suite, and the board a consolidated view of their entire GRC practice, so they can manage risk, build resilience, and make better decisions, faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We pioneered the modern governance movement and we are now leading its AI transformation. Curiosity is in our DNA. We look for people who ask the big questions, experiment fearlessly, and see change as opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Product Manager for IT &amp;amp; Cyber Risk, you will set the strategic direction for one of Diligent&#39;s most critical and fastest-growing product areas - defining how AI reshapes the way organisations identify, assess, and act on IT and cyber risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the product vision, roadmap, and outcomes for IT &amp;amp; Cyber Risk on the Diligent One Platform. You will partner closely with engineering, design, data science, and senior leadership to build products that give CISOs, risk managers, and boards the clarity they need when it matters most. This role carries real strategic weight and high executive visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Your Focus Area&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;643&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; AI Product Focus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Strategic Focus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Shape AI-powered risk detection &amp;amp; automation features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Own and evolve the IT &amp;amp; Cyber Risk product vision&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Define how LLMs surface cyber insights for boards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Influence roadmap across the Diligent One Platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Partner with engineering on AI model integration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Lead market and competitor intelligence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Translate AI capability into measurable user value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Drive OKRs and north star metrics with leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Evaluate emerging AI tools for risk workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;321&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Build business cases for strategic investment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Product Strategy &amp;amp; Vision&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and champion the multi-year product strategy for IT &amp;amp; Cyber Risk, aligned to Diligent&#39;s platform vision and company OKRs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep market intelligence: tracking competitor moves, emerging cyber regulations, and technology trends to shape the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and present compelling product business cases to senior leadership and the executive team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;AI-Powered Product Development&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of AI-native features that automate risk identification, prioritisation, and reporting for enterprise clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with data science and engineering teams to define how large language models and AI agents can enhance cyber risk workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track AI product performance metrics, ensuring features deliver measurable business and user outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay at the forefront of AI advances relevant to GRC, bringing new capability ideas to the roadmap proactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Roadmap &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full product lifecycle from discovery to launch across web, mobile, and API surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a prioritised, clearly articulated backlog with well-defined user stories and acceptance criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering leads to ensure technical feasibility, quality, and on-time delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and monitor product KPIs, user engagement metrics, and health indicators post-launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the authoritative voice of the customer: conducting regular research, interviews, and advisory sessions with CISOs, risk managers, and IT leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Sales, Customer Success, Professional Services, and Marketing to ensure successful go-to-market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product direction clearly and confidently to internal stakeholders at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Domain&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in product management, with significant SaaS experience in recent years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep domain knowledge in IT risk, cyber risk, or information security — you&#39;ve worked closely with CISOs, security teams, or risk functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of owning and delivering complex B2B product roadmaps end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or alongside GRC, compliance, or enterprise risk environments (highly desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical Acumen&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building or shaping AI-powered product features: you understand how LLMs, agents, and ML models work in practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging with engineering and data science teams on technical design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to evaluate AI use cases critically: balancing innovation with trust, explainability, and regulatory considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Leadership Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic thinking: you can connect daily product decisions to long-term business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, with experience influencing without authority across senior cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills; able to distil complexity into clear, compelling narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven decision maker: comfortable with product analytics, experimentation frameworks, and OKR setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ways of Working&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative by default: you thrive in inclusive, diverse teams and bring others along with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile mindset with experience in Scrum or similar delivery frameworks; Certified Scrum Product Owner is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and energized by building in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;643&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;312&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid working model&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Meeting-free focus days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Generous time off policy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;312&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Direct C-suite and board visibility&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI leadership opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global team &amp;amp; career development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;312&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comprehensive health benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wellness programmes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global days of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;312&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inclusive, diverse team culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Offices across 9 global hubs&lt;/p&gt;
