remotely-hellofresh:greenhouse:7195929.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;Job Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have multiple opportunities for &lt;strong&gt;Pick Packing, Food manufacturing &amp;amp; Hygiene Process workers &lt;/strong&gt;to join our manufacturing teams within our Karawatha (Southside of Brisbane) site on the Day, Afternoon or Night shifts. You would be responsible for performing a range of tasks related to the manufacture of Youfoodz products. Our teams are looking to fill multiple roles on the Early Morning AM (5-6am Starts), Afternoon PM (12-3pm Starts) &amp;amp; Overnights (8pm starts) which are spread across all days of the week. You must be available across a minimum of 4 days a week with a minimum of 8 hours per shift for rostering purposes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These positions are an ongoing casual position with the view to move to permanent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform basic food handling tasks in accordance with Good Manufacturing and Food Safety standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use provided equipment as instructed, or as reflected in documented policies, procedures or work instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high standards of personal hygiene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alert a Team Leader/Supervisor (or other appropriate person) where there is a concern in relation to product, quality, safety or process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that any provided personal protective equipment (PPE) is worn as intended for the entirety of shift when in the workspace and maintained at an acceptable standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform repetitive manual handling - ensuring that manual handling loads do not exceed 20kg for one individual, or that loads of more than 20kg are completed as a team lift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to traffic management policies and procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand for a prolonged period of time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other duties as reasonably required and directed&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have/are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a high volume, fast paced work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn Food Safety practices, HACCP and experience with WH&amp;amp;S principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform repetitive tasks with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift and move objects up to 20kg in some positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to work week days &amp;amp; weekends, minimum 8 hour shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to follow instructions accurately and efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound communication skills, including understanding of and conversational ability in the English language, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High levels of resilience, professionalism and work ethic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to make a significant impact at one of the fastest-growing global food technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A casual ongoing position with the view to transition to full-time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth and future development potential for the successful candidate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay and great long-term benefits working for a global business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 40% discount on Youfoodz products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a free meal onsite during your shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convenient on-site parking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt; Karawatha, Brisbane - Parking on site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Ongoing casual with the chance to move to permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#youfoodz&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Youfoodz, we are bringing a team of talented people together! You&#39;ll get to work with a team that says yes to new ideas, a team that is all about innovation, continuous improvement and delivering high quality food products 100% of the time!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are always looking for future superstars of the business and can offer the right candidates progression, future development and all that comes with it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking forward to creating the future of food together with you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

remotely-mapbox:ashbyhq:7369392e-92c0-4b.description:
Mapbox is the leading real-time location platform for a new generation of location-aware businesses. Mapbox is the only platform that equips organizations with the full set of tools to power the navigation of people, packages, and vehicles everywhere. More than 4 million registered developers have chosen Mapbox because of the platform’s flexibility, security and privacy compliance. Organizations use Mapbox applications, data, SDKs and APIs to create customized and immersive experiences that delight their customers. 


WHAT YOU'LL DO

 -  Full-cycle HR administration: recruitment, termination, vacations, staffing, timesheets, and reporting;

 - Drafting, managing, and amending employment contracts;

 - Absence management for payroll (sick leave, vacations, other absences);

 - Automate HR processes and record HR-related operations in 1C;

 - Develop local regulations, job descriptions, and other HR documentation;

 - Issue employment certificates and employee references

 - Military records maintenance;

 - Ensure labor protection and fire safety compliance with professional outsourcing support;

 - Provide legal support for business trips;

 - Manage correspondence, including drafting responses to government agencies;

 - Advise management and employees on labor law issues;

 - Provide contract law support when acting as Legal Counsel replacement (leases, supply contracts, service agreements, etc.);

 - Stay updated on relevant legal changes;

 - Participate in other complex and interesting tasks with the Operations team.


WHAT WE BELIEVE ARE IMPORTANT TRAITS FOR THIS ROLE

 -  Possesses good knowledge of labor and military registration laws in Belarus

 - The candidate should have a legal background (it’s not a must but something we focus on and are seeking for);

 - Experience with 1C module, experience in automation of HR Records-related processes, proficient computer skills, including relevant software applications;

 - At least one year of HR Records management experience in a 100+ employee company; independent and effective team player;

 - Strong document drafting skills, especially in HR Record-keeping;

 - English level - at least A2, preferably B1 and higher;

 - Highly responsible, detail-oriented, and results-driven;

 - Motivated, proactive, customer focused and committed to high-quality performance;

 - Able to provide two positive professional references.


WHAT WE VALUE

In addition to our core values https://www.mapbox.com/about/values/, which are not unique to this position and are necessary for Mapbox leaders:

 - We value high-performing creative individuals who dig into problems and opportunities.

 - We believe in individuals being their whole selves at work. We commit to this through supportive health care, parental leave, flexibility for the things that come up in life, and innovating on how we think about supporting our people.

 - We emphasize an environment of teaching and learning to equip employees with the tools needed to be successful in their function and the company.

 - We strongly believe in the value of growing a diverse team and encourage people of all backgrounds, genders, ethnicities, abilities, and sexual orientations to apply.

By applying for this position, you acknowledge that you have received the Mapbox Non-US Privacy Notice https://www.mapbox.com/legal/applicant-privacy-notice/ for applicants, which is linked here.  Completing this application requires you to provide personal data, such as your name and contact information, which is mandatory for Mapbox to process your application. 

We are committed to a fair and equitable hiring process. We do not discriminate against any protected class.


#LI-Remote

