techaviv-innovid:greenhouse:8586115002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovid is the leading independent omnichannel ad tech platform, empowering marketers to create, deliver, measure, and optimize ad-supported experiences that people love. In 2025, Innovid and Flashtalking merged to create a transparent, scalable alternative to big-tech, walled-gardens, and point solutions across CTV, digital, linear, and social channels. As part of Mediaocean, Innovid is tied into the industry’s core ad infrastructure for omnichannel planning, buying, and billing.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;‍&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are proud to lead the industry with our innovation, intelligence, and independence as the company best-suited to power the future of advertising.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for an exceptional Executive Administrator to support Innovid’s Chief Operating Officer (COO) and Chief Product Officer (CPO). As a trusted teammate, you will play a critical role in enabling these Executives to focus on strategic priorities by providing seamless administrative support and proactively managing schedules. You will also spearhead Talent Acquisition scheduling and support high-impact HR projects. This highly visible role requires a proactive, adaptable individual with a growth mindset who thrives in a fast-paced environment and takes pride in flawless execution.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our ideal candidate is resourceful, takes ownership, maintains composure under pressure, and brings a high degree of professionalism and discretion to every interaction. You are equally comfortable managing complex logistics, building relationships, and stepping in to support broader company initiatives when needed. This role reports to the VP, Human Resources.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a support, collaborator, proactive problem-solver, and trusted gatekeeper for the COO and CPO, ensuring their time and priorities are aligned with business objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline the interview process by managing interview schedules within Greenhouse, providing dedicated administrative support to the HR team, and driving special projects as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex scheduling, including professional and personal calendars, internal meetings across various Mediaocean business units, external meetings, and domestic and international travel.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate needs and take ownership of planning, executing, and delegating activities to maximize the COO and CPO’s bandwidth, especially when they are at office locations across the globe and particularly in New York City.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a liaison between the COO and CPO and internal/external stakeholders, fostering smooth communication and follow-up.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare materials, presentations, agendas, and briefing documents for meetings; ensure the COO and CPO are set up for success.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help organize and manage executive offsites, internal events, team lunches, and client-facing engagements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for company-wide initiatives including DE&amp;amp;I, ESG, Philanthropy, and other cultural efforts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other Executive support and departments to ensure unified support across the leadership team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high level of professionalism, confidentiality, and sound judgment at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and reconcile expense reports, invoices, and signed documents, following internal processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform additional administrative or project-based duties as needed to support the COO, CPO, and HR team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in logistics, project management, or Executive Administration in a dynamic, fast-paced environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building skills with a proactive, can-do attitude and natural problem-solving abilities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail with the ability to manage multiple competing priorities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in G-Suite, Microsoft Office (particularly PowerPoint and Excel), and comfort with learning new tools.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to interact professionally with all levels, including the board of directors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to exercise discretion, maintain confidentiality, and display sound critical thinking and judgment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with the ability to work independently while also collaborating effectively within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a hybrid position, and you will be expected to work in person in our NYC office 2 days per week. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Best of Both Worlds: &lt;/strong&gt;Be part of the Innovid team while enjoying the full range of perks and benefits offered by Mediaocean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Open Paid Time Off (PTO), Flexible schedule, Company holidays, paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary, Full benefits package, Referral bonuses, Recognition awards, 401(k) with company match, Company HSA contribution up to $2,400&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;Medical/Dental/Vision/Pharmacy, Health Savings Account (HSA)/Flexible Spending Account (FSA), Mental health support, Life &amp;amp; Disability insurance, Family planning &amp;amp; fertility benefits, Pet insurance, Legal &amp;amp; ID theft protection, Retirement planning, Medicare assistance, Employee Assistance Program (EAP),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Eligible employees get up to 100% company paid annual subscriptions to Peloton, Maven Clinic, BetterUp Care, Walkingspree, Bikeshare (Divvy in Chicago/Citibike in New York), Wellness Seminars (physical, mental, financial, social) as well as opportunities to compete in companywide health challenges with prizes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Award-Winning Company Culture: &lt;/strong&gt;Professional development with a dedicated Talent Development team, Employee Resource Groups (ERGs), Philanthropy &amp;amp; awareness programs, Mentorship programs, In-office and virtual events &amp;amp; celebrations, Various volunteer &amp;amp; donation opportunities, Innovative and collaborative work environment,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The base pay range for this position is $70,000 - $110,000 per year. The determination of what a specific employee in this job classification is paid and titled depends on a number of factors, including, but not limited to, prior employment history/job-related knowledge, qualifications and skills, length of service, and geographic location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This information is provided per New York City’s salary disclosure law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h5&gt;There is no such thing as the perfect resume, or someone that checks every box. At Innovid, we are generous with our time and knowledge, and always ready to teach. So however you identify and whatever background you bring with you, please apply if this is a role that would make you excited to come into work every day and add to Innovid.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: Innovid is an equal opportunity employer, committed to our diversity and inclusiveness. We consider all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability or age. We strongly encourage women, people of color, members of the LGBTQIA community, people with disabilities and veterans to apply. We are actively working to be an anti-racist organization. We&#39;re committing to creating an inclusive and equitable workplace for all of our employees. You can read more about our commitment to DEI &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.innovid.com/diversity-equity-inclusion/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;If you are located within the EEA and subject to GDPR or are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66b3742708fa503f625d311d/675c6ef2142d293f049c6df5_Innovid%20CCPA%20%26%20GDPR%20Applicant%20notifications.pdf&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to understand how Innovid processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

techaviv-similarweb:greenhouse:7826821.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;At Similarweb, we are revolutionizing the way businesses interact with the digital world by revealing to them everything that happens online. Our unique data and solutions empower over 6,000 customers globally, including industry giants like Google, eBay, and Adidas, to make game-changing decisions that drive their digital strategies. In 2021, we went public on the New York Stock Exchange, and we continue to reach new heights. Work alongside Similarwebbers from around the globe who are bright, curious, practical, and genuinely good people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Search is changing fast. AI-powered answers, generative results, and new ad formats are reshaping how people find information and how brands compete for attention. Similarweb sits at the center of that shift, giving marketers the intelligence they need to stay ahead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Solution Business Manager, Search &amp;amp; Ads Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; to bring their performance marketing expertise to the next level. This is not a generalist role. We want someone who has lived inside a performance marketing agency or large retailers or eCommerce with hands-on experience managing campaigns across organic and paid channels and can translate that real-world experience into value for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner with sales, account management, and customer success to win deals, deepen adoption, and position Similarweb as the go-to platform for marketers navigating today&#39;s complex search and paid media landscape. Also, you will also help shape our product roadmap by feeding market intelligence, your knowledge and client insights back to the product and data teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you get excited by keyword gaps, AI-generated search results, messy URLs, bidding strategy, audience overlap, and building custom workflows with AI tools, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role, Why Now&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The search and paid media landscape is going through its biggest shift in years:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) and Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) are creating entirely new strategies for organic and paid visibility that most clients are still figuring out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Paid search, social, display, and affiliate channels are increasingly interconnected, and marketers need unified intelligence to allocate budgets effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; AI tools are changing how campaigns are built, optimized, and reported on, and the practitioners who know how to work with them are already pulling ahead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Our clients need someone who can speak their language, understand their challenges, and show them how Similarweb solves problems they deal with every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your core focus is being the subject matter expert that clients and internal teams turn to when they need a real practitioner&#39;s perspective on search and paid media.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Revenue Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Partner with sales and account management to support deal cycles, RFPs, and renewal conversations, bringing hands-on practitioner credibility to every client interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Run discovery sessions to understand clients&#39; channel mix, budget allocation, and competitive challenges across SEO, AEO/GEO, Paid Search, Paid Social, Display, and Affiliate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Build tailored use case demos and data stories that speak directly to performance marketers, media planners, and agency strategists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Identify expansion opportunities within existing accounts by surfacing unmet needs across the client&#39;s full marketing stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search, AEO &amp;amp; GEO Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Guide clients on organic search strategy, including AEO and GEO, helping them understand how AI-generated results, featured snippets, and answer boxes are affecting their visibility and what to do about it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Help clients optimize for new search paradigms: LLM-referenced content, structured data, entity optimization, and topic-aligned content strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Apply keyword research, content gap analysis, technical SEO insights, and competitor benchmarking using Similarweb&#39;s suite alongside other tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Monitor how SERP landscapes evolve, track shifts in organic click-through rates driven by AI overviews, and translate those findings into actionable client recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Media Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Advise clients on competitive paid media strategy across Paid Search (SEM/PPC), Paid Social, Programmatic Display, AEO advertising, and Affiliate channels using Similarweb data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Help clients benchmark ad spend, identify competitor keyword bidding patterns, analyze share-of-voice, and uncover channel gaps across the competitive landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Connect organic and paid search insights to help clients make smarter cross-channel budget decisions and reduce wasted spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Support client and internal teams in suggesting or building client-facing reports and competitive audits powered by Similarweb data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Driven Workflows &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Actively use AI tools (LLMs, automation platforms, prompt engineering) to build workflows and agents that increase your output and the quality of deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Prototype custom analyses and solutions by combining Similarweb data with AI tools, giving clients a preview of what is possible beyond the standard product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Stay current on how AI is changing search, advertising, and marketing analytics, and bring that knowledge into client conversations proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Feedback &amp;amp; Market Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Evaluate the competitive landscape, emerging tools, and industry trends, sharing structured feedback with product and data teams. Such feedback should be curated and made applicable to various core industries we service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Facilitate client feedback sessions and user research to inform the product roadmap for Search and Ads Intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Monitor and report on product KPIs, adoption trends, and solution health across the book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; 6+ years of hands-on experience in performance marketing, with deep expertise in both SEO and paid media, ideally at a performance marketing agency managing multiple accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Practical experience across at least three of the following channels: Organic Search (SEO), Paid Search (PPC/SEM), Paid Social, Programmatic Display, Affiliate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Solid understanding of AEO and GEO: what it means to optimize for AI-generated answers, how LLMs surface content, and what marketers need to do differently now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Comfortable building with AI. You use AI tools regularly to do your work faster and better, and you can clearly explain how you do it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Strong analytical mindset, you dig into data, spot the story, and communicate it in a way that drives decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Excellent communication and presentation skills, comfortable in front of clients, execs, and internal teams alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Bias toward action, able to work across ambiguity, prioritize fast, and build things from scratch when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Experience working with B2B SaaS companies or marketing technology platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Familiarity with competitive intelligence tools or market research platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Experience presenting at industry events, writing thought leadership content, or building training programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Existing network within the performance marketing agency world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**At Similarweb, collaborating with our colleagues in the office creates a more connected, unified culture. Our best work is a product of our face-to-face collaboration, with the ability to work partially from home.**&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you’ll love being a Similarwebber:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll actually love the product you work with&lt;/strong&gt;: Our customers aren’t our only raving fans. When we asked our employees why they chose to come work at Similarweb, 99% of them said “the product.” Imagine how exciting your job is when you get to work with the most powerful digital intelligence platform in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll find a home for your big ideas&lt;/strong&gt;: We encourage an open dialogue and empower employees to bring their ideas to the table. You’ll find the resources you need to take the initiative and create meaningful change within the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer competitive perks &amp;amp; benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We take your well-being seriously and offer competitive compensation packages to all employees. We also strongly emphasize community, with regular team outings and happy hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can grow your career in any direction you choose:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Interested in becoming a VP or want to transition into a different department? Whether it’s Career Week, personalized coaching, or our ongoing learning solutions, you’ll find all the tools and opportunities you need to develop your career right here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity isn’t just a buzzword:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;People want to work in a place where they can be themselves. We strive to create a workplace that is reflective of the communities we serve, where everyone is empowered to bring their full, authentic selves to work. We are committed to inclusivity across race, gender, ethnicity, culture, sexual orientation, age, religion, spirituality, identity and experience. We believe our culture of equality and mutual respect also helps us better understand and serve our customers in a world that is becoming more global, more diverse, and more digital every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: We’re unable to sponsor employment visas at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-KZ #LI-Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
